@startuml
autonumber
actor User
participant "Angular Component" as App
participant "Adapter" as Adapter
participant "Backend API" as API

== 1. UPLOAD (Tạo Mapping) ==
User -> Adapter: Chọn ảnh
Adapter -> API: Upload File
API --> Adapter: Trả về { itemId: "img_001" }

Adapter -> Adapter: URL.createObjectURL(file)\n-> "blob:abc..."
Adapter -> App: Callback: map.set("blob:abc...", "img_001")
Adapter --> User: Hiển thị ảnh (src="blob:abc...")

== 2. SAVE (Hoán đổi SRC -> ID) ==
User -> App: Bấm Save
App -> App: Parse HTML
loop Tìm thẻ <img>
    App -> App: Lấy src ("blob:abc...")
    App -> App: Tìm trong Map -> ra "img_001"
    App -> App: Set data-s3-id="img_001"
    App -> App: Xóa src (src="")
end
App -> API: Gửi HTML sạch (chỉ có ID)

== 3. VIEW (Re-hydrate) ==
User -> App: Xem bài
App -> API: Get Content
API --> App: HTML (data-s3-id="img_001")
loop Tìm thẻ <img> có ID
    App -> API: Get Blob by ID
    API --> App: Blob Data
    App -> App: URL.createObjectURL(blob)\n-> "blob:xyz..."
    App -> App: Set src="blob:xyz..."
    note right: Quan trọng: Add lại vào Map\nđể nếu User bấm Save thì ko bị mất ID
    App -> App: map.set("blob:xyz...", "img_001")
end
@enduml